"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[59394],{59394:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/storm-wind-and-blade.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Shipu Rondo\\"\\n          author=\\"Keigo Higashino\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Bakha\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2014-01-03\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788965701866\\"\\n          rating=2.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe work intended to proceed as a thriller of a brain fight with an intelligent criminal at the beginning, but moves into the realm of unpredictable comedy.  \\n<br>\\nThe <mark>miscasting</mark> of a clumsy, ordinary, lethargic middle-aged researcher who took on all responsibility is used as a device for comic tension in a potentially boring case.  \\n<br>\\nHis clumsy and poor suspicious behavior invites suspicion from surrounding characters and constantly brings about unintended crises.  \\nIn such a situation, he accidentally meets two capable helpers and solves the case.  \\n<br>\\nThe hollow ending, which ended as a simple happening, seems to be a device that completes the ```comic irony``` that penetrates the entire work."}')}}]);